@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@priceSearchJobId = replace-with-PriceSearchJobId-from-identification-response

### Identify a car and automatically queue a price-search job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/identify
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarImageBoundary

--CarImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Image"; filename="car.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./car.jpg
--CarImageBoundary--

### Get the current price-search job status and result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/price-jobs/{{priceSearchJobId}}
